---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Container from "../components/Container.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Lights. Camera. Loyalty."
  description="Colorado-based filmmakers, engaging stories. Ignite your brand."
  classes={["font-humanist"]}
>
  <Nav />
  <div
    class="relative w-full h-dvh min-h-[500px] aspect-video flex justify-center items-center transition-all"
  >
    <div
      class="text-center z-40 text-gray-200 text-shadow-lg text-shadow-gray-800"
    >
      <h1 class="text-3xl lg:text-8xl font-bold">Lights. Camera. Loyalty.</h1>
      <p class="text-xl mt-8 lg:text-2xl lg:mt-12">
        We're Fictive Flame Media. We make films that convert viewers into
        customers, and customers into fans.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute w-screen h-4/5 bottom-0 z-11 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-950/0 to-gray-800"
    >
      <svg
        width="40px"
        height="100%"
        viewBox="0 0 247 390"
        class="mx-auto h-dvh mt-12 lg:mt-24 mb-4"
        version="1.1"
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
        style="fill-rule:evenodd;clip-rule:evenodd;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-miterlimit:1.5;"
      >
        <path
          id="wheel"
          d="M123.359,79.775l0,72.843"
          style="fill:none;stroke:#fff;stroke-width:20px;"></path>
        <path
          id="mouse"
          d="M236.717,123.359c0,-62.565 -50.794,-113.359 -113.358,-113.359c-62.565,0 -113.359,50.794 -113.359,113.359l0,143.237c0,62.565 50.794,113.359 113.359,113.359c62.564,0 113.358,-50.794 113.358,-113.359l0,-143.237Z"
          style="fill:none;stroke:#fff;stroke-width:20px;"></path>
      </svg>
      <style>
        @keyframes scroll {
          0% {
            transform: translateY(0);
          }
          30% {
            transform: translateY(100px);
          }
        }

        svg #wheel {
          animation: scroll ease 1.5s infinite;
        }
      </style>
    </div>
    <video
      autoplay
      loop
      muted
      playsinline
      poster="https://storage.fictiveflame.co/background-hd-poster.jpg"
      class="absolute z-10 inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
    >
      <source
        src="https://storage.fictiveflame.co/background-hd-portfolio.mp4"
        type="video/mp4"
      />
      Your browser does not support the video tag.
    </video>
  </div>
  <Container
    classes={[
      "grid",
      "mt-16",
      "px-6",
      "grid",
      "text-gray-700",
      "dark:text-gray-300",
      "lg:grid-cols-12",
      "lg:gap-8",
      "lg:px-0",
    ]}
  >
    <div
      class="relative p-6 mb-6 lg:mb-0 lg:col-span-4 rounded-2xl hover:bg-gray-600 transition-all hover:text-gray-200 outline-gray-500 outline-1"
    >
      <span class="flex justify-between items-center">
        <a href="/work">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-2xl lg:text-4xl">
            <span class="absolute w-full h-full inset-0"></span>
            Featured Work
          </h3>
        </a>
        <span>&rarr;</span>
      </span>
      <p class="text-wrap mt-4">
        In today's world, stories are currency. From the first words though to
        the finished product, we can help you make an impact.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="relative p-6 mb-6 lg:mb-0 lg:col-span-4 rounded-2xl hover:bg-gray-600 transition-all hover:text-gray-200 outline-gray-500 outline-1"
    >
      <span class="flex justify-between items-center">
        <a href="/services">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-2xl lg:text-4xl">
            <span class="absolute w-full h-full inset-0"></span>
            Services
          </h3>
        </a>
        <span>&rarr;</span>
      </span>
      <p class="text-wrap mt-4">
        Some may say art and science don't mix, but for us there's no other way.
        We are broadcast engineers and filmmakers, all in service of your story.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="relative p-6 lg:col-span-4 rounded-2xl hover:bg-gray-600 transition-all hover:text-gray-200 outline-gray-500 outline-1"
    >
      <span class="flex justify-between items-center">
        <a href="#contact">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-2xl lg:text-4xl">
            <span class="absolute w-full h-full inset-0"></span>
            Get In Touch
          </h3>
        </a>
        <span>&rarr;</span>
      </span>
      <p class="text-wrap mt-4">
        If you have an idea that's out of the ordinary, we want to hear it.
        Pitch your idea to a team who can see the future of storytelling.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Container>
  <Container classes={["mt-16", "px-6", "lg:px-0"]}>
    <div
      class="overflow-hidden relative h-[500px] rounded-2xl bg-gray-100 transform duration-300 hover:scale-105"
    >
      <div
        class="relative flex h-full items-center text-gray-200 align-middle justify-center p-8"
      >
        <div class="font-bold z-40 antialiased text-center">
          <span
            class="text-2xl lg:text-4xl block mb-4 text-shadow-lg text-shadow-gray-900"
            >Made in Colorado</span
          >
          <p class="text-xl font-light">
            We're proud to hail from the American West, with it's breathtaking
            views and rugged landscapes. As filmmakers, we document it. As
            conservationists, we leave everywhere cleaner and never interrupt
            nature.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="absolute w-screen h-full bottom-0 z-11 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-950/0 to-gray-950"
        >
        </div>
        <video
          autoplay
          loop
          muted
          playsinline
          class="absolute inset-0 z-10 h-full w-full object-cover"
        >
          <source
            src="https://storage.fictiveflame.co/red-rocks-sample.mp4"
            type="video/mp4"
          />
        </video>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
  <Footer />
  <script is:inline slot="google-tracking">
    gtag("event", "conversion", {
      send_to: "AW-17137403373/9xm-CP_A3dAaEO2L4Os_",
      value: 1.0,
      currency: "USD",
    });
  </script>
</Layout>
